# Locally generated question sets and drafting notes. Not pipeline inputs, and
# the rules forbid "lookup tables keyed to question text" -- a repo carrying
# large question dumps invites exactly that reading of it. Kept out so a later
# `git add -A` cannot sweep them in.
heldout_questions*.json
nic_test_questions.json
*prompt*.md
*.pptx
